{
  "slug": "agent-limits",
  "name": "Agent Limits",
  "title": "用量限制卡片",
  "category": "agents",
  "files": [
    "components/agent-limits/agent-limits.tsx"
  ],
  "description": "AI 方案的用量卡片：上下文窗口占用（按系统提示词、对话、文件分段），请求与搜索等额度的仪表条（接近上限自动变色），重置倒计时，以及升级入口。",
  "keywords": [
    "usage",
    "limits",
    "quota",
    "context window",
    "tokens",
    "plan",
    "用量",
    "额度",
    "上下文",
    "配额",
    "升级"
  ],
  "exports": [
    "AgentLimits"
  ],
  "demos": [
    {
      "file": "agent-limits/overview.tsx",
      "title": "概览",
      "description": "resetsAt 传入时间点，卡片在客户端显示「x 小时 y 分钟后重置」。",
      "height": 420
    },
    {
      "file": "agent-limits/near-limit.tsx",
      "title": "接近上限",
      "description": "额度超过 75% 变为警告色、90% 变为危险色，升级按钮随之变为主按钮。",
      "height": 420
    },
    {
      "file": "agent-limits/in-popover.tsx",
      "title": "嵌入弹出层",
      "description": "variant=\"plain\" 去掉卡片外框，适合放在输入框旁的用量弹层中。",
      "height": 200
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "额度条复用 Meter，颜色之外还会显示「接近上限 / 已达上限」文字。",
    "相对重置时间只在客户端计算并每 30 秒刷新，服务端渲染为空，避免水合不一致；也可以用 description 直接写死文案。",
    "上下文分段默认依次使用图表色 chart-1…6，可用 color 自定义。"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "component": "AgentLimits",
      "props": [
        {
          "name": "title",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "卡片标题。",
          "default": "\"用量\""
        },
        {
          "name": "plan",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "方案名，显示为标题旁的徽标。"
        },
        {
          "name": "context",
          "type": "{ limit: number; segments: AgentContextSegment[] }",
          "description": "上下文窗口大小与占用分段。"
        },
        {
          "name": "quotas",
          "type": "AgentQuota[]",
          "description": "额度列表：{ id, label, used, limit, unit?, resetsAt?, description? }。"
        },
        {
          "name": "onUpgrade",
          "type": "() => void",
          "description": "传入后显示升级按钮。"
        },
        {
          "name": "upgradeLabel",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "升级按钮文字。"
        },
        {
          "name": "upgradeHint",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "升级按钮旁的说明。"
        },
        {
          "name": "variant",
          "type": "\"card\" | \"plain\"",
          "description": "外观。",
          "default": "\"card\""
        },
        {
          "name": "labels",
          "type": "Partial<AgentLimitsLabels>",
          "description": "覆盖内置文案。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "isNew": true
}
